    "text": "KSLA\nwebsite\nWebster Parish\nBond set at $185K for former Webster Parish deputy accused of malfeasance and falsifying documents\nBy KSLA Staff,\n10 hours agoWEBSTER PARISH, La. (KSLA) - Webster Parish Sheriff Jason Parker announced Wednesday (June 25) the arrest of a recently terminated deputy following a criminal investigation into misconduct involving falsified official documents. Former Detective Spencer White was arrested at the Webster Parish Sheriff’s Office earlier Wednesday after a warrant was issued...\n1",
